### Producer Batching Configuration

Confluent.Kafka producer automatically batches messages. Configure batching parameters:

```csharp
// Producer configuration for optimal batching
var producerConfig = new ProducerConfig
{
    BootstrapServers = kafkaBootstrapServers,

    // Batching configuration
    LingerMs = 100,                     // Wait up to 100ms to batch messages
    BatchSize = 16384,                  // 16KB batch size (default)
    BatchNumMessages = 10000,           // Max 10,000 messages per batch

    // Compression (reduces network bandwidth)
    CompressionType = CompressionType.Snappy,  // or Lz4, Gzip, Zstd
    CompressionLevel = 3,               // Compression level (1-9)

    // Performance tuning
    Acks = Acks.All,                    // All in-sync replicas must acknowledge
    MaxInFlight = 5,                    // Allow 5 in-flight batches
    EnableIdempotence = true,           // Exactly-once semantics

    // Buffering
    QueueBufferingMaxMessages = 100000, // Max messages in queue
    QueueBufferingMaxKbytes = 1048576,  // Max 1GB buffer

    // Timeouts
    MessageTimeoutMs = 300000,          // 5 minute message timeout
    RequestTimeoutMs = 30000            // 30 second request timeout
};
```

